{"id":"7b364b0997153626","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber.md","title":"Theorem — 闭拓扑层的终对象纤维判据","display":"Theorem — 闭拓扑层的终对象纤维判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber","aliases":["14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber"],"display":"Theorem — 闭拓扑层的终对象纤维判据","source_ref":"Derived from IX.4 p.486 (12), DjVu249 left, V.2 and IV.6 gluing","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]","[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","[[14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 闭拓扑层的终对象纤维判据"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Derived from IX.4 p.486 (12), DjVu249 left, V.2 and IV.6 gluing"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2b82e142840e429\" href=\"?note=b2b82e142840e429\" title=\"14-thm-open-closed-closure\">14-thm-open-closed-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f584a450845e8d6\" href=\"?note=4f584a450845e8d6\" title=\"14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits\">14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1\">\\(\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1\\)</span> 与闭拓扑。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U\">\\(\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U\\)</span> 为投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 为初对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsJSheaf}(X,j_U^{\\mathrm c},\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsJSheaf}(X,j_U^{\\mathrm c},\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为闭拓扑层，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\hookrightarrow B\\times U\">\\(0\\hookrightarrow B\\times U\\)</span> 是闭拓扑稠密单射，因为该对象上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 支撑为全子对象。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}(B\\times U,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}(B\\times U,X)\\)</span> 恰有一个元素；等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times U\\to U\">\\(X\\times U\\to U\\)</span> 为切片中的终对象箭头，即为同构。</p>\n<p>反向，投影可逆意味着任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\to U\">\\(C\\to U\\)</span> 都有且仅有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\to X\">\\(C\\to X\\)</span>。闭稠密 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:A\\hookrightarrow B\">\\(a:A\\hookrightarrow B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vee U_B=B\">\\(A\\vee U_B=B\\)</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to X\">\\(f:A\\to X\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_B\">\\(U_B\\)</span> 上取唯一箭头到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap U_B\">\\(A\\cap U_B\\)</span> 上相等，故沿满态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A+U_B\\twoheadrightarrow B\">\\(A+U_B\\twoheadrightarrow B\\)</span> 粘合。满态射是其核对的余等化子；核对的四个分块是两对角和两个交叠，所以相等条件恰好保证唯一粘合。所得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\to X\">\\(B\\to X\\)</span> 唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=0\">\\(U=0\\)</span> 时判据对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=1\">\\(U=1\\)</span> 时判据恰要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为终对象，与<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b2b82e142840e429\" href=\"?note=b2b82e142840e429\" title=\"14-thm-open-closed-closure\">14-thm-open-closed-closure</a>的拓扑退化一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-open-closed-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b2b82e142840e429","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1$ 与闭拓扑。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，$\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U$ 为投影；$0$ 为初对象。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-open-closed-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b2b82e142840e429","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"反向，投影可逆意味着任意 $C\\to U$ 都有且仅有一个 $C\\to X$。闭稠密 $a:A\\hookrightarrow B$ 满足 $A\\vee U_B=B$。给定 $f:A\\to X$，在 $U_B$ 上取唯一箭头到 $X$，两者在 $A\\cap U_B$ 上相等，故沿满态射 $A+U_B\\twoheadrightarrow B$ 粘合。满态射是其核对的余等化子；核对的四个分块是两对角和两个交叠，所以相等条件恰好保证唯一粘合。所得 $B\\to X$ 唯一。$U=0$ 时判据对每个 $X$ 成立，$U=1$ 时判据恰要求 $X$ 为终对象，与[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]的拓扑退化一致。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsJSheaf}(X,j_U^{\\mathrm c},\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\pi_U:X\\times U\\to U).","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"0\\hookrightarrow B\\times U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}(B\\times U,X)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times U\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"C\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"C\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"a:A\\hookrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\vee U_B=B","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"U_B","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cap U_B","display":false},{"tex":"A+U_B\\twoheadrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"B\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"U=0","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"U=1","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":2043,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber|thm-243 — 闭拓扑层的终对象纤维判据]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]"},{"id":"74d933333cdc3eff","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这给出原书的开子 locale $U\\hookrightarrow X$ 和对应闭子 locale $X-U\\hookrightarrow X$ 的具体 frame，而[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]、[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]、[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]、[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]研究的是初等拓扑斯中的 LT 拓扑、层对象与开闭子拓扑斯，类型和新增构造不同。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber|thm-243 — 闭拓扑层的终对象纤维判据]]"}],"outgoing":["46d4e2094b01f6d4","b2b82e142840e429","9135c45b14ec366c","ce0c3e433ca617db","4f584a450845e8d6","4cd3b0d29b80beda","d5f547b903550705"]}